#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6238
msgid ""
"When enabled, disables WordPress built-in gallery window and uses "
"MetaSlider Gallery for images set to \"Enlarge on Click\". When disabled, "
"respects WordPress setting and skips images set to \"Enlarge on Click\"."
msgstr ""
"Kapag pinagana, pinipigilan ang built-in na gallery window ng WordPress at "
"gumagamit ng MetaSlider Gallery para sa mga imaheng nakatakdang \"Palakihin "
"sa Pag-click\". Kapag hindi pinagana, iginagalang ang setting ng WordPress "
"at nililipat ang mga imaheng nakatakdang \"Palakihin sa Pag-click\"."

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6254
msgid "Override \"Link to Image File\" Setting"
msgstr "I-overwrite ang \"Link to Image File\" na Setting"

#: class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:6255
